      "claim": "Since the amount of nirmatrelvir/ritonavir in the milk is expected to be low, it is not expected to cause side effects in nursing infants. However, if you suspect the baby has any symptoms (such as diarrhea or irritability), contact the child’s healthcare provider. Be sure to talk to your healthcare provider about all your breastfeeding questions.",
